{quiz}
  Which tag repeats its content while a condition holds? | while | if | set | case
  How is a single tag written? | {echo $x/} | {echo $x} | {/echo $x}
  Which sigil prints a field without the sanitize chain? | ! | $ | # | ?
  What does a pipe hand on? | a value to a function | a page to a server | a row to a store
  Where do the files of an application's own tags go? | _tags | _include | _lib | _data
  What does seed= give a game? | the same board on every load | a faster script | more players
{/quiz}
